# Minimal MAVProxy script: load only tpcm (when the module is installed).
# Body forward (FC<->GCS) remains active regardless of this file.
#
# The systemd unit does not use this: it passes --default-modules=tpcm. This is
# for an interactive run on the board, where MAVProxy reads no script by path.
# Copy it to ~/.mavproxy/mavinit.scr, which MAVProxy loads on startup, or pass
# the same thing on the command line: --cmd="module load tpcm"
module load tpcm
